      "mergeID": "5d4a07729060a3742dbc521d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "So a few weeks ago I noticed an issue with the steamvr beta where in vrchat the trigger from my vive wands would not gradually change the animation anymore. It changed to an instant on/off. Previously this wasn't the case and I could for example close my fists partially.\n\nI fixed it by downgrading to the release but now valve put it in that version as well.\n\nHave they changed the way certain things work and is there a way to fix it in vrchat?",
      "mergedPostTitle": "steamvr vive trigger not working gradually anymore",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5d435d7e7a96ad29a07161aa",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
